ady by keeping the tighter. The first "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pattern"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pattern"},{"type":"text","text":", with its example in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"examples"},{"type":"text","text":"; any other is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pattern"},{"type":"text","text":" of its own under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"allOf"},{"type":"text","text":". A bound with a fraction is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written as a JSON number with one."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Beside each document is the event’s example, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<name>.v<version>.example.json"},{"text":": a conformance","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vector, the payload of the event with every property present and set to a fixed value its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"schema accepts. Another platform’s code can encode the same event and compare. A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"string"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"example\""},{"text":" (cut to its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxLength"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"x"},{"text":" repeated to a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"minLength"},{"text":" above 7, or its pattern’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"example), one of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"format"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"date-time"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"2001-01-01T00:00:00Z\""},{"text":" and one of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"format"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"uuid"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the nil UUID; a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"number"},{"text":" or an ","type":"text"},{"typ